  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GLOBAL PANEL ON AGRICULTURE AND FOOD SYSTEMS FOR NUTRITION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3 years. This duration will enable Credit Unions (CUs) to enhance the positive impact on the livelihoods of members. It will enable the CU movement to develop their services and operations, to grow membership, progress depth of outreach and advance to-wards effective CU supervision. The timeframe will enable Na-tional Cooperative Credit Union Association (NaCCUA) to consoli-date its structure and develop its service and income streams. Fi-nally, it will enable the Department of Cooperatives (DoC) super-vision processes to be developed, tested and trialled under a con-trolled environment.</narrative>
  </description>
